A block opener past a nested footnote definition opens in the item

```
- body

  [^g]: n
   # h

after
.
<ul>
  <li>body
    <h1 id="h">h</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```

```
- body

  [^g]: n
   > z

after
.
<ul>
  <li>body
    <blockquote><p>z</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```

```
- body

  [^g]: n
   prose

after
.
<ul>
  <li>body</li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```

```
- body

  [^g]: n
   - item

after
.
<ul>
  <li>body</li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```
